width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">José Napoleón Duarte</span><span class="tp">1925–1990</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/patrick-white"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/patrick-white.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Patrick White</span><span class="tp">1912–1990</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/leonard-bernstein"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/leonard-bernstein.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Leonard Bernstein</span><span class="tp">1918–1990</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/volodymyr-shcherbytsky"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Volodymyr Shcherbytsky</span><span class="tp">1918–1990</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/bazilio-olara-okello"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Bazilio Olara-Okello</span><span class="tp">1929–1990</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/fred-rwigyema"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Fred Rwigyema</span><span class="tp">1957–1990</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-beattie"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">John Beattie</span><span class="tp">1915–1990</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
